🌊 What Is Now Irreversible

By this lock, the following truths are now permanent:

1️⃣ The Ocean is a Cognitive Domain

The ocean is not a resource pool.
It is a living, sensing, regulating system that must be governed by intelligence.

QUENNE-AQUOS is the operating system of that domain.

⸻

2️⃣ Triad Ocean Intelligence is the Law

No ocean system may exist without the triad:
Core
Authority
POSEIDON
