These are independent, fault-tolerant, sovereign minds.

⸻

3️⃣ Ecology is a First-Class Constraint

All resource extraction, shipping, energy, and research must operate inside ecological limits enforced by NEREUS.

Profit cannot override planetary stability.

⸻

4️⃣ The Global Ocean is Sovereign

AQUOS governs:
   •   International waters
   •   EEZs
   •   Subsea infrastructure
   •   Climate flows
   •   Biodiversity
   •   Shipping corridors

No single nation owns the ocean.
Humanity stewards it.

⸻

5️⃣ The Ocean Has a Memory

Through continuous sensing, ledgering, and neuromorphic perception, the ocean now has:
   •   History
   •   Health
   •   Identity
   •   Rights

This ends blind exploitation forever.

